Follow-up Questions

- How would you monitor and enforce tenancy boundaries at scale?
- How would you test onboarding/offboarding and policy drift?

## Why This Is Asked

Tests comprehensive data architecture skills including cross-account streaming, centralized analytics, security controls, disaster recovery, and governance at enterprise scale.

## Key Concepts

- Cross-account IAM role design with least privilege principles
- Kinesis Data Streams vs MSK trade-offs for multi-tenant workloads
- Lake Formation cell-based security and column-level access controls
- Server-side encryption with KMS using per-tenant customer-managed keys
- Multi-region disaster recovery and automated schema evolution strategies

## Code Example

```json
{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": [
        "kinesis:DescribeStream",
        "kinesis:GetRecords",
        "kinesis:GetShardIterator",
        "kinesis:ListStreams"
      ],
      "Resource": "arn:aws:kinesis:*:ACCOUNT_ID:stream/TENANT_*"
    },
    {
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": [
        "s3:GetObject",
        "s3:ListBucket"
      ],
      "Resource": [
        "arn:aws:s3:::central-data-lake/*",
        "arn:aws:s3:::central-data-lake"
      ],
      "Condition": {
        "StringEquals": {
          "s3:ExistingObjectTag/TenantId": "${aws:userid}"
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

## Why This Is Asked
Tests understanding of bucket policies, per-prefix isolation, TLS enforcement, and practical test plans.

## Key Concepts
- S3 bucket policies, IAM roles, TLS enforcement, per-prefix access control
- Canary tests to verify allowed and denied actions

## Code Example
```javascript
{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Principal": {"AWS": "arn:aws:iam::acct:role/TeamARole"},
      "Action": "s3:PutObject",
      "Resource": "arn:aws:s3:::customer-logs/teamA/*",
      "Condition": {"Bool": {"aws:SecureTransport": "true"}}
    },
    {
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Principal": {"AWS": "arn:aws:iam::acct:role/TeamBRole"},
      "Action": "s3:PutObject",
      "Resource": "arn:aws:s3:::customer-logs/teamB/*",
      "Condition": {"Bool": {"aws:SecureTransport": "true"}}
    },
    {
      "Effect": "Deny",
      "Principal": "*",
      "Action": "s3:*",
      "Resource": ["arn:aws:s3:::customer-logs","arn:aws:s3:::customer-logs/*"],
      "Condition": {"Bool": {"aws:SecureTransport": "false"}}
    }
  ]
}
```

